{"id":57492,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57492"},"modified":"2026-08-28T21:01:55","modified_gmt":"2026-08-28T20:01:55","slug":"grande-premio-da-vinha-e-do-vinho","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-da-vinha-e-do-vinho\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre O <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>1.\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de Novembro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong>Borba<\/strong>, no distrito de \u00c9vora. Organizado pelo Munic\u00edpio de Borba com o apoio t\u00e9cnico da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de \u00c9vora, o evento alia o atletismo \u00e0 celebra\u00e7\u00e3o da rica tradi\u00e7\u00e3o vitivin\u00edcola e ao patrim\u00f3nio da regi\u00e3o do Alentejo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o marcada junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o de Eventos de Borba, o programa inicia-se \u00e0s <strong>08h40<\/strong> com as provas jovens, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> a <strong>Corrida Principal de 10 km<\/strong> e \u00e0s <strong>09h35<\/strong> a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>. O evento \u00e9 de <strong>inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita<\/strong> e apresenta uma vertente solid\u00e1ria, revertendo 1\u20ac por participante para a Liga Portuguesa Contra o Cancro. Se procura preparar o seu calend\u00e1rio de provas, pode consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas em Portugal<\/a> ou calcular os seus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">calculadora de pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o garante um enquadramento festivo com entrega de pr\u00e9mio monet\u00e1rio para os p\u00f3dios gerais e medalhas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o para todos os atletas que cortem a linha de meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 2026 (09h30)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o de Eventos de Borba, Borba, \u00c9vora<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Corrida Principal 10 km, Caminhada 5 km e Provas Jovens<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Munic\u00edpio de Borba<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 3 - GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Percurso<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso do <strong>Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 maioritariamente urbano, desenhado sobre asfalto e cal\u00e7ada pelas principais art\u00e9rias da cidade de Borba. Partindo do Pavilh\u00e3o de Eventos, a corrida atravessa tro\u00e7os emblem\u00e1ticos da localidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O perfil altim\u00e9trico caracteriza-se pelas suaves ondula\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00edpicas do relevo alentejano, oferecendo uma corrida fluida, acess\u00edvel e prop\u00edcia para desfrutar da paisagem e do ambiente festivo da cidade.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 4 - CALCULADORA DE PACE --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcule o seu Tempo Alvo no Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;\">Utilize a nossa calculadora de pace para definir parciais ideais e gerir o seu ritmo de corrida com precis\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 0%, #8B5CF6 100%); color: #0F172A; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 5 - ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Borba<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para atletas e fam\u00edlias que pretendem pernoitar na regi\u00e3o antes ou depois do <strong>Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026<\/strong>, recomendamos reservas antecipadas em zonas estrat\u00e9gicas de Borba:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Borba (Centro Hist\u00f3rico):<\/strong> Excelente op\u00e7\u00e3o para ficar a passos da zona de partida no Pavilh\u00e3o de Eventos.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Vila Vi\u00e7osa e Estremoz:<\/strong> Proximidade geogr\u00e1fica (5 a 10 km) com vasta oferta de unidades hoteleiras e turismo de habita\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Eixo A6 \/ Regi\u00e3o de \u00c9vora:<\/strong> Excelentes acessos rodovi\u00e1rios para quem viaja no Alentejo Central.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 6 - GASTRONOMIA & ACOMPANHANTES --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia Regional<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A regi\u00e3o de <strong>Borba<\/strong> oferece um patrim\u00f3nio cultural e paisag\u00edstico rico. Ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o da prova, os participantes podem desfrutar dos sabores locais da gastronomia regional, como <em>ensopado de borrego, migas \u00e0 alentejana, sopas de p\u00e3o, queijo de Borba, do\u00e7aria tradicional alentejana e vinhos DOC Alentejo de Borba<\/em> em restaurantes t\u00edpicos da localidade.<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &#038; Espectadores<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Os acompanhantes e fam\u00edlias podem assistir \u00e0 prova e apoiar os atletas em locais estrat\u00e9gicos como <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o de Eventos de Borba (Partida\/Meta), Centro Hist\u00f3rico e Fonte das Bicas<\/strong>, desfrutando da anima\u00e7\u00e3o e do acolhimento local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO CROSS-LINKING --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Outras Provas Recomendadas na <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mesma Regi\u00e3o<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Descubra tamb\u00e9m outros eventos desportivos de relevo agendados para a \u00e9poca: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/event-location\/borba-evora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">outras corridas recomendadas no distrito de \u00c9vora<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 7 - FAQS ALINHADAS COM FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas Frequentes <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">(Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026)<\/span><\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de Novembro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>. Os hor\u00e1rios das v\u00e1rias partidas por prova e escal\u00e3o s\u00e3o os seguintes:<br \/>\u2022 08h40 \u2014 In\u00edcio das Provas de Escal\u00f5es Jovens (750m a 3000m)<br \/>\u2022 09h30 \u2014 Partida da Corrida Principal 10 km<br \/>\u2022 09h35 \u2014 Partida da Caminhada 5 km<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A partida realiza-se no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o de Eventos de Borba<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Borba<\/strong> e distrito de <strong>\u00c9vora<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis no Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial disponibiliza as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>Corrida Principal 10 km, Caminhada 5 km e Provas Jovens<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Grande Pr\u00e9mio da Vinha e do Vinho 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 assegurada por <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Borba<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e os tempos oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidos na p\u00e1gina da prova no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento. A fotorreportagem e as galerias de imagens poder\u00e3o ser pesquisadas atrav\u00e9s dos canais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e nas plataformas parceiras de cobertura fotogr\u00e1fica desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":